<gpx creator="StravaGPX" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd">
 <metadata>
  <name>Into Phillips Park without cobbles</name>
  <desc>Run into Phillips down and then up the road to the main car park entrance.  Keep going down the hill (enjoy the view),  keep going past the house and gardens and then keep running down through a big open area.  Keep running down past kingfisher thingie until you reach a tunnel go through that an then a quick right and follow the path to the left along the motorway run along this until the end then turn left and run back  until your reach our normal route through Drinkwater park just keep running straight along until you reach our 4 way sign, we will probably active regroup here and have people run back to people at the back.  Otherwise turn  left towards Mere Clough.

Enjoy this and then the teeny tiny hill at the end  to take the bridge across the motorway before turning left and returning to Philips</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Run Together Whitefield</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/44862010"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3387439267419308868"/>
 </metadata>
 <trk>
  <name>Into Phillips Park without cobbles</name>
  <desc>Run into Phillips down and then up the road to the main car park entrance.  Keep going down the hill (enjoy the view),  keep going past the house and gardens and then keep running down through a big open area.  Keep running down past kingfisher thingie until you reach a tunnel go through that an then a quick right and follow the path to the left along the motorway run along this until the end then turn left and run back  until your reach our normal route through Drinkwater park just keep running straight along until you reach our 4 way sign, we will probably active regroup here and have people run back to people at the back.  Otherwise turn  left towards Mere Clough.

Enjoy this and then the teeny tiny hill at the end  to take the bridge across the motorway before turning left and returning to Philips</desc>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3387439267419308868"/>
  <type>running</type>
